exports[`golden set — deterministic path (exact) > wtc-after-contact matches its snapshot 1`] = `
"Suggested child-conscious wording for practitioner review (write this with, and for, the child):

This is what happened, in plain words: you were upset after [family time] and thats ok. staff sat with you til you felt better. we are proud of how you managed it
What adults did to help: [describe what staff did, calmly and kindly].
What happens next: [describe the next step you agreed].
Still to add for the child: What did staff do to help? Record the adult response, not only the child's behaviour.."
`;

exports[`golden set — deterministic path (exact) > wtc-certificate matches its snapshot 1`] = `
"Suggested child-conscious wording for practitioner review (write this with, and for, the child):

This is what happened, in plain words: you got your maths certificate today!! everyone was well pleased for you
What adults did to help: [describe what staff did, calmly and kindly].
What happens next: [describe the next step you agreed].
Still to add for the child: What did the child say or show? Include their voice — or record carefully how they communicated without words.; Include human detail — how was the day for the child, not only what was done?; What did staff do to help? Record the adult response, not only the child's behaviour.."
`;

